4, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.2332814930015552}, {"text": "surface-to-air missile and a 15 mm rapid-firing gun, The probability of success in", "x0": 0.24505494505494504, "y0": 0.23561430793157076, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.24727838258164853}, {"text": "hitting an attacking aircraft with each line of defence is respectively 0.9 and 0.8,", "x0": 0.24395604395604395, "y0": 0.24961119751166408, "x1": 0.8164835164835165, "y1": 0.26127527216174184}, {"text": "Find the probability of hitting an attacking aircraft before it penetrates both defences.", "x0": 0.26153846153846155, "y0": 0.27216174183514774, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.2838258164852255}, {"text": "Question 8. (Use a separate book.)", "x0": 0.14615384615384616, "y0": 0.3818040435458787, "x1": 0.3967032967032967, "y1": 0.39346811819595645}, {"text": "(i) Draw sketches (not on graph paper) of", "x0": 0.22087912087912087, "y0": 0.4082426127527216, "x1": 0.5230769230769231, "y1": 0.4191290824261275}, {"text": "(@ from \u00ab= \u2014m to z= 7;", "x0": 0.25054945054945055, "y0": 0.43390357698289267, "x1": 0.5846153846153846, "y1": 0.4447900466562986}, {"text": "from z= \u2014I to", "x0": 0.3901098901098901, "y0": 0.4603421461897356, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.468895800933126}, {"text": "y", "x0": 0.5131868131868131, "y0": 0.5015552099533437, "x1": 0.5417582417582417, "y1": 0.5171073094867807}, {"text": "(0,2)", "x0": 0.521978021978022, "y0": 0.52099533437014, "x1": 0.5703296703296703, "y1": 0.5404354587869362}, {"text": "mC", "x0": 0.6857142857142857, "y0": 0.7107309486780715, "x1": 0.7241758241758242, "y1": 0.7192846034214619}, {"text": "(-1,0) (4,0)", "x0": 0.35274725274725277, "y0": 0.7216174183514774, "x1": 0.6604395604395604, "y1": 0.7402799377916018}, {"text": "(ii) An ornamental arch window 2 metres wide and 2 metres high is to be made in the", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.7636080870917574, "x1": 0.8670329670329671, "y1": 0.7752721617418351}, {"text": "shape of an are of either a cosine curve or a parabola, as illustrated on axes above.", "x0": 0.24285714285714285, "y0": 0.7776049766718507, "x1": 0.8461538461538461, "y1": 0.7892690513219285}, {"text": "(a) If the arch is made in the shape of the curve", "x0": 0.24835164835164836, "y0": 0.8040435458786936, "x1": 0.5934065934065934, "y1": 0.8149300155520995}, {"text": "y= 200s", "x0": 0.3934065934065934, "y0": 0.833592534992224, "x1": 0.46593406593406594, "y1": 0.8444790046656299}, {"text": "find the area of the window. (Your answer may be left in terms of 7.)", "x0": 0.27472527472527475, "y0": 0.8615863141524106, "x1": 0.7835164835164835, "y1": 0.8732503888024883}, {"text": "(b) If the arch is made the shape of an arc of a parabola, find the equation of the", "x0": 0.24725274725274726, "y0": 0.8950233281493002, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.9066874027993779}, {"text": "parabola and the area of the window.", "x0": 0.27362637362637365, "y0": 0.9090202177293935, "x1": 0.5428571428571428, "y1": 0.9206842923794712}, {"text": "35", "x0": 0.46923076923076923, "y0": 0.9580093312597201, "x1": 0.4846153846153846, "y1": 0.9665629860031104}], [{"text": "Question 9. (Use a separate book.)", "x0": 0.13076923076923078, "y0": 0.04432348367029549, "x1": 0.3824175824175824, "y1": 0.05598755832037325}, {"text": "(i) Given log, 3 = 1.15851, find, correct to two decimal places:", "x0": 0.20549450549450549, "y0": 0.06998444790046657, "x1": 0.6681318681318681, "y1": 0.08164852255054432}, {"text": "(a) log, 95", "x0": 0.23406593406593407, "y0": 0.08942457231726283, "x1": 0.321978021978022, "y1": 0.11119751166407466}, {"text": "(b) log, 12.", "x0": 0.23186813186813188, "y0": 0.11586314152410575, "x1": 0.3230769230769231, "y1": 0.12674961119751166}, {"text": "ii) Show that the tangents to the graphs y = logex and y = at the points where", "x0": 0.2, "y0": 0.14852255054432348, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.16018662519440124}, {"text": "2 =I are parallel.", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.16329704510108864, "x1